CCFF\">Weight\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">5 lbs\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Location\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\"><b><a href=\"/page/Old_Tomb,_New_Tenants\" title=\"Old Tomb, New Tenants\">Old Tomb, New Tenants</a></b>, End chest\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#AACCFF\">Enhancements\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#CCEEFF\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+7 Enhancement Bonus</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">+7 Enhancement Bonus</a>:</b> +7 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Riposte\" title=\"Riposte\">Riposte VIII</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Riposte\" title=\"Riposte\">Riposte VIII</a>:</b> When Missed by an attack: Deals 8 to 32 damage to your attacker. Passive: +4 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Armor_Class\" title=\"Armor Class\">Armor Class</a>, +4 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Fortitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude\">Fortitude</a>, <a href=\"/page/Reflex\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Reflex\">Reflex</a>, and <a href=\"/page/Will\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Will\">Will</a> <a href=\"/page/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throws</a>.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Elemental_Resistance#Inherent_Resistances\" title=\"Elemental Resistance\">Competence Elemental Resistance - 10</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Elemental_Resistance#Inherent_Resistances\" title=\"Elemental Resistance\">Competence Elemental Resistance - 10</a>:</b> This item provides a +10 <a href=\"/page/Insight_bonus\" title=\"Insight bonus\">Insight bonus</a> to your Acid, Cold, Fire, and Electrical resistances.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Corrosive_Salt_Guard\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Corrosive Salt Guard\">Corrosive Salt&#32;Guard</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Corrosive_Salt_Guard\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Corrosive Salt Guard\">Corrosive Salt&#32;Guard</a>:</b> This item stores a caustic, insatiable power deep within. When the wearer of this item is successfully attacked in melee, this power can come to the surface in the form of a noxious, corrosive salt that dissolves all substances.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Vulnerability_Guard\" title=\"Vulnerability Guard\">Vulnerability&#32;Guard</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Vulnerability_Guard\" title=\"Vulnerability Guard\">Vulnerability&#32;Guard</a>:</b> This item stores powerful erosive forces. When the wearer is missed in combat, this power occasionally releases a degrading blast, adding three stacks of <a href=\"/page/Vulnerable\" title=\"Vulnerable\">vulnerability</a> to all enemies nearby.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Sheltering\" title=\"Sheltering\"> Sheltering +12</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Sheltering\" title=\"Sheltering\"> Sheltering +12</a>:</b> +12 <a href=\"/page/Enhancement_bonus\" title=\"Enhancement bonus\">Enhancement bonus</a> to <a href=\"/page/Physical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Physical Resistance Rating\">Physical</a> and <a href=\"/page/Magical_Resistance_Rating\" title=\"Magical Resistance Rat